------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WEB-SOURCE PARITY (every branch reproduced natively)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Web SourceLayerBadge is a debugger badge naming a signal value's provenance. Reproduced verbatim:
  * STYLE lookup: key = (source ?? 'unknown').toLowerCase(); STYLE[key] ?? STYLE.unknown.
      l1   -> "L1"   emerald (success token)  "Read from the in-process SignalStore (hot path, freshest)."
      l2   -> "L2"   blue    (info token)     "Read from Redis cross-pod cache (legacy entry; freshness unknown)."
      log  -> "LOG"  neutral surface          "Replayed from signal_log (durable history)."
      stale-> "STALE"amber   (warning token)  "Redis-backed value older than the 2-minute freshness window."
      unknown->"—"   neutral surface          "Source layer unknown."   (null / "" / unrecognized fallback)
  * formatAge(ms): null/!finite->nil; <1000->"{round} ms"; <60k->"{/1000 .1f} s"; <3.6M->"{round/60k} min";
      <86.4M->"{/3.6M .1f} h"; else "{/86.4M .1f} d"  — ported verbatim, i18n-routed, fixed '.' decimal.
  * tooltip = ageText ? `${desc} (${t('sourceLayer.age','age')}: ${ageText})` : desc.
  * showLabel prop -> min width 40pt (2.5rem) vs 24pt (1.5rem).
States rendered (no hidden surface): loading skeleton · unavailable retry · ready(l1/l2/log/stale/
unknown — unknown "—" IS the empty readout, never a blank box) · offline (cached badge + offline marker).
P4 leaf contract layered on the presentational web badge: crossing INTO the `stale` layer arms a single
auto-refresh; offline never auto-refreshes. Telemetry view.opened emitted once on first ready (slug
"SourceLayerBadge"). All copy via P1/S10 i18n facade; all color via P1/S9 tokens; TSButton/TSSkeleton
reused; no Tailwind ports, no raw hex. All public types prefixed `SourceLayerBadge*` because the bare
`SignalSourceLayer` already belongs to the SnapshotInspector surface (single app module — collision avoided).

